Maxwell's demon should also be able to decrease Entropy.  Here's an
idea (might be hard to implement, though).
When MD envelops you, all corpses you carry start getting fresher.
Sounds great, doesn't it?  Guess again.  After they become as fresh as
possible, they come back alive.  And mad.  On the upside, MD
enveloping would probably restore rust-damaged stuff (assuming you
have non-rustproof stuff by the time you get to Gehenomm anyway).
Lots of cold traps (places where the MD has moved energy from a low
spot to a high spot) would be good on the level.

